00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:58.490
I did take a couple of road trips

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:01.080
and tried the camping thing,
so I did get out and about,

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:03.090
but mostly stuck close to home.

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:04.410
Yeah i know this has all of us.

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:06.333
That was awesome i wasn't
expecting you to say your house.

00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:09.853
Since we're stuck at home, i
invited Emily to help us plan

00:01:09.853 --> 00:01:13.320
the perfect restful and
relaxing staycation,

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:15.660
